{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eTZ4q7YnO21795515083.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港首隻「無紙化」新股掛牌。</p><p></p><p>有股份過戶處指，證券無紙化運作暢順。自證券無紙化上周一啟動以來，中央證券登記指，首隻無紙化新股，有逾五成白表散戶於認購時，已提供持股易識別碼，反映投資者積極開立持股易戶口，為日後轉讓無紙證券作準備。</p><p></p><p>另外，過去一星期，也有560人開立持股易戶口，按周急升1.2倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.931076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:37:34.417646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:57:16.545979+00:00","content_hash":"b1b40da24ad7eb7f25073f422f945423981b3bc206f7f51f84445b19c1154b23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.931076+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}